      "context_url": "https://x.com/judahgabriel",
      "title": "So glad for Kirk Cousins returning to the Vikings. I've known him since he was a little kid. His father, Don, is the one who introduced me to @markmittelberg and hired me away from my journalism career to join the staff of a church (at a 60% pay cut!). Don is now pastor of a church in Orlando -- and Mark and I have been ministry partners since 1987. Kirk is the real deal!",
